---
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/icon_magda.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="Magdalena Szymaniec — Senior Product Designer & Art Director based in Berlin." />
    <title>Magdalena Szymaniec</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:wght@600&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      body {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        background-color: #f7f6fa;
        color: #302b36;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      a:not(.btn-cv) {
        color: #302b36;
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
        text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
        text-decoration-color: #c8c5d0;
        transition: color 0.15s ease, text-decoration-color 0.15s ease;
      }

      a:not(.btn-cv):hover {
        color: #9b90cc;
        text-decoration-color: #9b90cc;
      }

      .page {
        width: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      main {
        flex: 1;
        padding: 40px 24px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .header img {
        width: 64px;
        height: 63px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .header-text {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 3px;
      }

      .name {
        font-family: 'Lora', serif;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .job-title {
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: #827d87;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }

      h1 {
        font-family: 'Lora', serif;
        font-size: 1.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.35;
      }

      .intro {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        color: #302b36;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      .cta {
        padding: 8px 0;
      }

      .btn-cv {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #9b90cc;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
      }

      .btn-cv:hover {
        background-color: #8778bc;
      }

      footer {
        background-color: #eae5fc;
        padding: 24px 24px 40px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .links {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
        list-style: none;
      }

      .links a {
        font-size: 0.9375rem;
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      .copyright {
        font-size: 0.8125rem;
        color: #827d87;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      @media (min-width: 640px) {
        main {
          padding: 80px clamp(48px, 8vw, 160px);
          gap: 24px;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: 3rem;
          max-width: 22ch;
          line-height: 1.15;
        }

        .name {
          font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .job-title {
          font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .intro {
          font-size: 1rem;
          max-width: 52ch;
        }

        footer {
          padding: 40px clamp(48px, 8vw, 160px) 56px;
        }

        .links {
          flex-direction: row;
          gap: 32px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="page">
      <main>
        <div class="header">
          <img src="/icon_magda.svg" alt="" width="49" height="48" />
          <div class="header-text">
            <p class="name">Magdalena Szymaniec</p>
            <p class="job-title">Senior Product Designer · Art Direction</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h1>Hi, Magdalena here! I'm a creative human based in Berlin, Germany.</h1>

        <p class="intro">
          Welcome to my portfolio. It's currently a work in progress. Feel free to reach out at <a href="mailto:magda.szymaniec@gmail.com">magda.szymaniec@gmail.com</a>
        </p>

        <div class="cta">
          <a href="/CV_magdalena.pdf" class="btn-cv" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">download my CV</a>
        </div>
      </main>

      <footer>
        <ul class="links">
          <li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/magdalena-szymaniec-6a697246" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://magdalenadraws.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Illustration Portfolio</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/magdalenadraws/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="copyright">All works © Magdalena Szymaniec, 2026. Please do not reproduce without the expressed written consent of the author.</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
